    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Thunder rings out from your strike, audible within 300 feet of you, and the target takes an extra 2d6 Thunder damage from the attack. If the target is a creature, it must also succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed 10 feet away from you and have the &amp;Reference[prone apply=false]{Prone} condition.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-n1IWlJ5CQXC5z2XU\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>On a failed save, push the target 10 feet by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
